From bb0352ffa7d61b62dec281cfd88a59de2fe13493 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eryk Wieliczko <eryk@wieliczko.ninja>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:17:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/27] soc: apple: pmp: publish owner-managed T8132 telemetry

Extend the PMP registry/report contract and link read-only telemetry
with the Rust firmware owner. Select CoreAnalytics before mailbox RX
only for the qualified T8132/J713 instance; other firmware keeps its
previous startup contract. Record consistency does not establish
an advancing firmware temperature heartbeat.

